Hygiene: template binders cannot capture, template names resolve at the definition.
$[Import* std]
$[Macro !swapArgs {{f a b} {f b a}}]
${!swapArgs - 1 10}
expect: 9
$[Macro !withTmp {{e} {{^ {tmp} {+ tmp e}} 1}}]
$[# tmp 100]
${!withTmp tmp}
expect: 101
${{^ {+} {!withTmp 2}} 0}
expect: 3
$[Macro !nest {{e} {!withTmp {!withTmp e}}}]
${!nest 0}
expect: 2
Holes inside template strings are hygienic too; operands reach them through a template binder.
$[# tag "lib"]
$[Macro !label {{v} {{^ {val} [f "$tag: $val"]} v}}]
${{^ {tag} {!label 1}} "user"}
expect: "lib: 1"
